   "content": "<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Activity 1: Trace a Loop</h2><details class=\"lesson-tps\"><summary><span class=\"lesson-tps-steps\">Think <b>&rarr;</b> Pair <b>&rarr;</b> Share</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-q\">Why does Total start at 0?</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-reveal\">Show the answer</span></summary><div class=\"lesson-tps-a\"><p>Nothing has been added yet. If it started at 5, the total would be 5 too big.</p></div></details><div id=\"y8r1-embed-1\" class=\"lesson-embed\"></div>"
