   "validatorKey": "y8r1_flowchart_check",
   "content": "<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Check: Flowchart Symbols</h2><details class=\"lesson-tps\"><summary><span class=\"lesson-tps-steps\">Think <b>&rarr;</b> Pair <b>&rarr;</b> Share</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-q\">Why is box 2 a sloping box?</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-reveal\">Show the answer</span></summary><div class=\"lesson-tps-a\"><p>It takes a value in from the user. Input and output use the sloping box.</p></div></details><div class=\"lesson-do-now-columns\"><div><div class=\"lesson-fc\" style=\"--fc-box:var(--surface-2);--fc-edge:var(--brand);--fc-term:var(--muted);--fc-ink:var(--ink);--fc-dec:rgba(253,214,99,.12);--fc-dec-edge:var(--warn);--fc-arrow:var(--brand);--fc-label:var(--warn);--fc-badge:var(--warn);--fc-badge-ink:#1f1400;display:flex;justify-content:center\"><svg style=\"max-width:100%;max-height:380px;height:auto\" class=\"fc-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 388 316\" width=\"388\" height=\"316\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Start; INPUT Mark; Mark &gt;= 50? (True to OUTPUT &quot;Pass&quot;, False to OUTPUT &quot;Fail&quot;); OUTPUT &quot;Pass&quot;; OUTPUT &quot;Fail&quot;; End\"><style>.fc-b{fill:var(--fc-box,#262a5a);stroke:var(--fc-edge,#8ab4f8);stroke-width:2}.fc-t{fill:var(--fc-box,#262a5a);stroke:var(--fc-term,#9aa0c8);stroke-width:2}.fc-d{fill:var(--fc-dec,#3a2f10);stroke:var(--fc-dec-edge,#fdd663);stroke-width:2}.fc-line{stroke:var(--fc-edge,#8ab4f8);stroke-width:2;fill:none}.fc-e{stroke:var(--fc-arrow,#9aa6ff);stroke-width:2;fill:none}.fc-x{fill:var(--fc-ink,#eef0ff);font:600 14px/1 system-ui,Roboto,sans-serif;text-anchor:middle}.fc-sm{font-size:13px}.fc-l{fill:var(--fc-label,#fdd663);font:700 13px system-ui,Roboto,sans-serif}.fc-title{fill:var(--fc-label,#fdd663);font:700 13px system-ui,Roboto,sans-serif}.fc-n{fill:var(--fc-badge,#fdd663)}.fc-nt{fill:var(--fc-badge-ink,#1f1400);font:800 13px system-ui,sans-serif;text-anchor:middle}</style><defs><marker id=\"fc2a\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" style=\"fill:var(--fc-arrow,#9aa6ff)\"/></marker></defs><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M100 48 L100 78\" marker-end=\"url(#fc2a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M100 114 L100 131\" marker-end=\"url(#fc2a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M100 189 L100 206\" marker-end=\"url(#fc2a)\"/><text class=\"fc-l\" x=\"110\" y=\"203\" text-anchor=\"start\">Yes</text><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M188 160 L296 160 L296 206\" marker-end=\"url(#fc2a)\"/><text class=\"fc-l\" x=\"196\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"start\">No</text><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M100 242 L100 272\" marker-end=\"url(#fc2a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M296 242 L296 288 L152 288\" marker-end=\"url(#fc2a)\"/><rect class=\"fc-t\" x=\"48\" y=\"16\" width=\"104\" height=\"32\" rx=\"16\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"100\" y=\"36.5\">Start</text><circle class=\"fc-n\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"18\" r=\"11\"/><text class=\"fc-nt\" x=\"50\" y=\"22.5\">1</text><polygon class=\"fc-b\" points=\"34,78 180,78 166,114 20,114\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"100\" y=\"100.5\">INPUT Mark</text><circle class=\"fc-n\" cx=\"22\" cy=\"80\" r=\"11\"/><text class=\"fc-nt\" x=\"22\" y=\"84.5\">2</text><polygon class=\"fc-d\" points=\"100,131 188,160 100,189 12,160\"/><text class=\"fc-x fc-sm\" x=\"100\" y=\"164.5\">Mark &gt;= 50?</text><circle class=\"fc-n\" cx=\"14\" cy=\"133\" r=\"11\"/><text class=\"fc-nt\" x=\"14\" y=\"137.5\">3</text><polygon class=\"fc-b\" points=\"34,206 180,206 166,242 20,242\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"100\" y=\"228.5\">OUTPUT &quot;Pass&quot;</text><circle class=\"fc-n\" cx=\"22\" cy=\"208\" r=\"11\"/><text class=\"fc-nt\" x=\"22\" y=\"212.5\">4</text><polygon class=\"fc-b\" points=\"230,206 376,206 362,242 216,242\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"296\" y=\"228.5\">OUTPUT &quot;Fail&quot;</text><circle class=\"fc-n\" cx=\"218\" cy=\"208\" r=\"11\"/><text class=\"fc-nt\" x=\"218\" y=\"212.5\">5</text><rect class=\"fc-t\" x=\"48\" y=\"272\" width=\"104\" height=\"32\" rx=\"16\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"100\" y=\"292.5\">End</text><circle class=\"fc-n\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"274\" r=\"11\"/><text class=\"fc-nt\" x=\"50\" y=\"278.5\">6</text></svg></div></div><div class=\"lesson-exam-card\"><div class=\"lesson-do-now-responses\"><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response\"><label for=\"y8r1-flowchart-check-a\">(a) What is the name of the shape for box 3? [1]</label><input id=\"y8r1-flowchart-check-a\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"flowchart-check-a\" aria-label=\"Check: Flowchart Symbols part a\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response\"><label for=\"y8r1-flowchart-check-b\">(b) What is the name of the shape for box 6? [1]</label><input id=\"y8r1-flowchart-check-b\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"flowchart-check-b\" aria-label=\"Check: Flowchart Symbols part b\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response\"><label for=\"y8r1-flowchart-check-c\">(c) Mark is 40. Which box number runs: 4 or 5? [1]</label><input id=\"y8r1-flowchart-check-c\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"flowchart-check-c\" aria-label=\"Check: Flowchart Symbols part c\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"donow-btn\" id=\"y8r1-flowchart-check-check\">Check answers</button><strong>Total: 3 marks</strong></div><div id=\"y8r1-flowchart-check-feedback\" class=\"pseudocode-feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></div></div>"
