  {
   "id": "activity-2",
   "label": "Activity 2: Flowchart to Pseudocode",
   "type": "app-link",
   "buttonId": "y8r1-activity2-btn",
   "appId": "flowchartblitz",
   "content": "<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Activity 2: Flowchart to Pseudocode</h2><details class=\"lesson-tps\"><summary><span class=\"lesson-tps-steps\">Think <b>&rarr;</b> Pair <b>&rarr;</b> Share</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-q\">Why does a Decision become IF ... THEN ... ELSE ... ENDIF?</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-reveal\">Show the answer</span></summary><div class=\"lesson-tps-a\"><p>A Decision chooses between two paths. IF chooses between the THEN line and the ELSE line.</p></div></details><p class=\"lesson-lead\">Open Flowchart Blitz. Choose <strong>Flowchart to Pseudocode</strong>.</p><ul class=\"lesson-facts\"><li>Read the flowchart from Start to End.</li><li>Write one line for each shape.</li><li>Start with DECLARE for each new variable.</li></ul><div class=\"lesson-app-link\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"donow-btn\" id=\"y8r1-activity2-btn\">Open Flowchart Blitz</button></div>"
  },
