   "embedContainerId": "y8r1-plenary",
   "content": "<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Plenary: Revision 1 Drill</h2><details class=\"lesson-tps\"><summary><span class=\"lesson-tps-steps\">Think <b>&rarr;</b> Pair <b>&rarr;</b> Share</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-q\">Why practise with new numbers every time?</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-reveal\">Show the answer</span></summary><div class=\"lesson-tps-a\"><p>If you can do it with any numbers, you really understand it.</p></div></details><p class=\"lesson-lead\">Key words, sequence, selection and loops. Your progress is saved.</p><div id=\"y8r1-plenary\"></div>"
  }
